Scope: direct operator request — native macOS tray/application menus/titlebar gestures behind bboxy450-term-desktop portable actions, Linux adapter later. Desktop companion lives beside existing supervisor and survives UI detach; private same-run kernel-peer bridge preserves ctl opt-in and refuses harness descendants. Tests use owned fixtures, no operator input or OS injection.
Native facade: 11 portable application actions,4 tray actions, native validated Edit responders, owned AppKit menus/status item, system titlebar policy and click interval, Fill/restore and native window operations. Native callbacks enqueue; daemon has an accessory runloop and process-exit notification, no lifetime polling. Finder/Dock reopen routes Show.
App integration: desktop daemon survives UI detach and can attach to an older live supervisor; Show un-hides/activates or reopens same run/repository. Private kernel-peer callback socket has16 receive slots,128-byte framing and1-second deadline; cached supervisor ancestry rejects seats and retains the GUI exception. Supervisor recovery updates the cached anchor and ensures a new desktop host. ctl opt-in and GUI/MCP protocols unchanged.
Window titlebar: retained painted bounds route close/minimize/fullscreen, background drag only on physical native input, deterministic double-click clock tests, modal/control exclusions and hand cursor. Menus and native controls share application actions; ordinary Quit detaches; explicit CmdOptionQ/Stop All shuts down owners with birth-checked fallback. CmdShiftQ stays reserved.
make test-desktop — exit0; portable menu/serde unit, all-target strict Clippy, real AppKit menu11/tray4 callbacks, Fill/None/Zoom/restore/Minimize/Show and native runloop disposal. Probe uses separate main-queue phases, not a blocked nested callback. Controlled native investigation found unconditional deminiaturize can overtake a later minimize; Show now guards isMiniaturized.
make test-desktop-app — exit0; IPC peer-admission unit,3 titlebar gesture tables and all-target app strict Clippy. Additional GUI-branch ancestry table is included for final normal CI.
make test-desktop-lifecycle — exit0; private HOME/account, fake claude, actual native daemon + headless UI. Show/Settings/NewTab/Close/Show preserve supervisor+logic identities and running harness PID/generation; explicit hard quit stops this private run. Same test registered in night boundary selector.
make test-boundaries — exit0; shell PATH/admission/control/private custody/process detach/restart/shutdown suite. No operator input, real SSH, credential prompt or OS input injection. Logs outside Git in ~/Library/Logs/bboxy450-term/desktop-20261028-*.log. Final exact-source CI, signed install/smoke and land.sh receipt follow this commit in their normal logs.
